// Classification trees, forests and boosting (reference: sklearn 1.2.1):
// - DecisionTreeClassifier (gini / entropy): predict and predict_proba exact
// - labels are returned unchanged (here -1.5 / 0.5 / 2.0), classes sorted
// - RandomForestClassifier without bootstrap / feature sampling = one tree;
//   predict = argmax of the averaged class probabilities (soft voting)
// - GradientBoostingClassifier (log loss, binary + multinomial) predict_proba
// - classifiers survive save → load bit-exactly
// (the data were checked to have no equal-gain splits in sklearn for 8 seeds)

